{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Pace:</strong> Discover a peaceful and gorgeous world, free from any pressure. There are no enemies or time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/a2faa6adca275f52304cb99fbd3bdeb1.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Explorer: </strong>No interface or quest markers here to show you the way. Your curiosity will be your only guide, and forging a path to certain places will be a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras_big/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559 width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe and Solve</strong>: The artworks offer you fairly simple puzzles to solve. It's up to you to understand their logic to activate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/c9045030af140044680245eff08710dd.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World with a Past:</strong>  Find the audio logs and piece together what happened in the park before your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/43dc6a00a9b284dc0f3f0ab97c28bef0.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect New Abilities: </strong>Find equipment to help you climb, glide, or light your way to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Hundred Square","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Rings Align","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Desert Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Fractured Maiden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Glowing Howl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Patient Frog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Old Lion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Lonely Cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Still Stack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"},{"name":"Watchful Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889780/96901753855b0a4132bc23fbf2ade1afb7514327.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889780?t=1771923559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889780?t=1771923559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/7e422c3e28a4385b