amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras_big/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559 width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe and Solve</strong>: The artworks offer you fairly simple puzzles to solve. It's up to you to understand their logic to activate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/c9045030af140044680245eff08710dd.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World with a Past:</strong>  Find the audio logs and piece together what happened in the park before your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/43dc6a00a9b284dc0f3f0ab97c28bef0.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect New Abilities: </strong>Find equipment to help you climb, glide, or light your way to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Marmot Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/3e8aa37758a3239ddbb9d41c2de822dc92804e67/header.jpg?t=1771923559","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Yann Le Coroller <br />\r\nAll rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnreal\u00ae Engine is a trademark of Epic Games, Inc.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"